### 批B：tick/observation/终端转换 + result/checkpoint 摄入 + 依赖冻结 + 异常 fail-closed（A2/A5/A6）

| # | 改动文件 | 怎么改 | 怎么验 |
|---|---------|--------|--------|
| B1 | Modify · `tools/relay/runner/relay-runner.ps1`（追加） | ①内部 `Set-RelayNodePaused([hashtable]$Run,[string]$NodeId,[string]$Reason)`：task_state='paused'、scheduling='paused'、pause_reason=$Reason、Save。②内部 `Apply-RelayObservation([hashtable]$Run,[string]$NodeId,[hashtable]$Obs)`（`$Obs=@{ok; terminal_state; probe_error}`）：node 非 launched 直接返回；**probe_error**：`consecutive++`；事件 `observation`（Extra: probe_error=$true, consecutive_probe_failures=n, terminal_state=当前）；`Get-RelayProbeVerdict n $params 当前终端 当前业务` triggered → `Test-RelayTransitionPair terminal_move result_move` 不 ok→仍 paused reason `probe-lost`（并把不 ok 原因写进 observation 事件 reason）；ok→应用两维、Save、paused reason `probe-lost`。**成功**：consecutive=0；`observed=$Obs.terminal_state`；同当前→事件 `observation`（terminal_state=observed）不刷新 last_progress_at 返回；不同→`Test-RelayTerminalTransition 当前 observed`：不 ok→事件 `observation` reason=`transition-rejected:<reason>`（terminal_state=当前）+ paused reason `illegal-terminal-transition`；ok→terminal=observed、last_progress_at=now、事件 `observation`(terminal_state=observed)；若 observed='exited' 且 `-not final_committed`→`Get-RelayExitWithoutResultVerdict @{terminal_state='exited'; result_status; final_result=$null}` → `Test-RelayResultTransition` ok 则 result=interrupted_unknown + paused reason `exit-without-result`（若当前 result 已是 interrupted_unknown 等无合法边则只 paused）；若 exited 且 final_committed→仅记录（scheduling 保持 succeeded/blocked）。③`Invoke-RelayTick([hashtable]$Run)`：now=clock；(a) `$host=& adapter.emit_observation $Run` → 按 session_id 找节点逐条 Apply；(b) 对每个 `scheduling='launched'` 节点：`Apply (& adapter.probe session_id)`；(c) 仍 launched 且 terminal='launching' 且 now ≥ launch_deadline_at → 终端 launching→unknown（判矩阵）+ 事件 `launch_failed` reason=`launch-deadline-exceeded` + paused reason `launch-deadline-exceeded`；(d) 仍 launched → `Get-RelayStallVerdict @{terminal_state; result_status; last_event_at=last_progress_at} now params` stalled → `Test-RelayTransitionPair` → 应用 + 事件 `observation` reason=`stall-threshold-exceeded`（terminal_state='unknown'）+ paused reason `stalled`；返回 `@{ now; probed=@(node ids) }`。④`Submit-RelayResultFile([hashtable]$Run,[string]$NodeId,[string]$Path)`：node 不存在→`@{ok=$false; reason='unknown-node'}`（不追加事件）；attempt_id=0→事件 `result_rejected` reason `no-attempt`；`Current=@{node_id;attempt_id;launch_id;session_id;final_committed}`；`$auth=Read-RelayAuthority`、`$ap=Read-RelayActivePlan`；先 try 解析 `$Path`（失败→事件 `result_rejected` reason `unparseable-result`、返回）；`$v=Get-RelayResultVerdict $obj $auth $ap $Current`；按 K-2 映射：非 accept→事件 `result_stale`/`result_rejected`（identity=对象里 7 字段子集，reason=$v.reason）→返回 `@{ok=$false; verdict; reason}` **且不改 state**；accept→`Test-RelayResultTransition 当前 result_status $obj.result_status`：reason='reserved-target-form'（quota）→事件 `result_rejected` reason `reserved-target-form` + 应用 K-7（result=interrupted_unknown 走 `Test-RelayResultTransition` 判、paused reason `quota-fallback`）返回；其它不 ok→事件 `result_rejected` reason=<矩阵 reason> 返回；ok→`Write-RelayJsonCreateNew attempts/<node>/<attempt>/result.json`（存在→事件 `result_rejected` reason `final-immutable` 返回）；state：final_committed=$true、result_status、next_action、last_progress_at=now、清除所有节点 frozen_by 中的本 node；按状态：succeeded→scheduling='succeeded'（**task_state 保持 'active'**）；dependency_blocked→scheduling='blocked'、`replan_required=$true`、Save、事件 `result_accepted`、**然后** `& adapter.stop session_id`（先 ack 后回收；stop 结果 ok=false 只记 findings 不改状态）；interrupted_unknown→paused reason `worker-reported-interruption`；Save；事件 `result_accepted`（succeeded/interrupted 路径在这里追加；blocked 路径已追加）；返回 `@{ok=$true; result_status}`。⑤`Submit-RelayCheckpointFile([hashtable]$Run,[string]$NodeId,[string]$Path)`：同样解析失败→`checkpoint_rejected` reason `unparseable-checkpoint`；`Get-RelayCheckpointVerdict`→非 accept→事件 `checkpoint_rejected` reason=$v.reason 返回不改 state；accept：status 同当前→进度更新（K-5）；不同→`Test-RelayResultTransition` 不 ok→`checkpoint_rejected` reason=<矩阵 reason>；ok→result_status=status；若新状态 `decision_required`→`Get-RelayNo